  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Three identical capacitors <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi> </mi><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> have a capacitance of <math><mn>1.0</mn><mi> </mi><mi>μ</mi><mi>F</mi></math> each and they are uncharged initially. They are connected in a circuit as shown in the figure and <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> is then filled completely with a dielectric material of relative permittivity <math><msub><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></math> . The cell electromotive force (emf) <math><mrow> <msub> <mi>V</mi> <mn>0</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mi> </mi><mo>=</mo><mi> </mi><mn>8</mn><mi> </mi><mi>V</mi></math> . First the switch <math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> is closed while the switch <math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is kept open. When the capacitor <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> is fully charged, <math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> is opened and <math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is closed simultaneously. When all the capacitors reach equilibrium, the charge on <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> is found to be <math><mn>5</mn><mi> </mi><mi>μ</mi><mi>C</mi></math> . The value of <math><msub><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></math> =____________.<br ><img src=\"assets\\qt0007_904c5dec0bdc.jpeg\"/></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1.5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0007_dad71404b257.jpg\"/>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"assets\\st0007_35ba09fe3938.jpg\"/>\r\n\r\nApplying loop rule\r\n\r\n<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>∈</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>\r\n\r\n<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>∈</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>\r\n\r\n<math><msub><mrow><mo>∈</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.50</mn></math>"
  }
}